flowchart TB
    Pod["StatefulSet pod<br/>LevelDB writer"]:::stateful
    Hook["preFreeze hook<br/>SIGTERM-aware<br/>fsfreeze /data"]:::compute
    LVM["LVM thin snapshot<br/>(LD-consistent view)"]:::storage
    CSI["AWS EBS-CSI driver<br/>VolumeSnapshot CRD"]:::compute
    Velero["Velero<br/>backup orchestrator"]:::ctrl

    subgraph schedA["Schedule A — operational (5-min cadence, source region only)"]
        direction LR
        EBSsrcA["EBS Snapshot<br/>(source region · gp3)"]:::storage
        BSLsrcA["S3 BSL — source<br/>(Velero metadata)"]:::data
    end

    subgraph schedB["Schedule B — DR (4-hour cadence, cross-region)"]
        direction LR
        EBSsrcB["EBS Snapshot<br/>(source region)"]:::storage
        BSLsrcB["S3 BSL — source"]:::data
        BSLdr["S3 BSL — DR replica"]:::data
        EBSdr["EBS Snapshot<br/>(DR region)"]:::storage
    end

    Restore["Path A / B / C<br/>Velero restore<br/>(per ADR-04)"]:::ctrl

    Pod -->|writes| Hook
    Hook -->|freeze + snapshot trigger| LVM
    LVM -->|VolumeSnapshot CR| CSI
    CSI -->|create snapshot| Velero

    Velero -->|Schedule A 5-min| EBSsrcA
    EBSsrcA -.->|metadata| BSLsrcA

    Velero -->|Schedule B 4-hour| EBSsrcB
    EBSsrcB -.->|metadata| BSLsrcB
    BSLsrcB ==>|"S3 cross-region replication"| BSLdr
    BSLdr ==>|"VSL cross-region copy"| EBSdr

    EBSsrcA -.->|operational restore<br/>~25 min RTO| Restore
    EBSdr -.->|DR restore<br/>~50 min RTO| Restore

    classDef stateful fill:#fff3e0,stroke:#f57c00,color:#bf360c,stroke-width:3px
    classDef compute fill:#e3f2fd,stroke:#1976d2,color:#0d47a1
    classDef storage fill:#fce4ec,stroke:#c2185b,color:#880e4f
    classDef ctrl fill:#e8eaf6,stroke:#3f51b5,color:#1a237e
    classDef data fill:#e0f2f1,stroke:#00695c,color:#004d40
